  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation and Sustainable Management of High-Value Arid Ecosystems in the Lower Amu Darya Basin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to secure high value arid ecosystem biodiversity and associated ecosystem services, while ensuring resilient and sustainable livelihoods in Tajikistan&#x2019;s lower Amu Darya landscape. The project&#x2019;s components have been designed to address key threats and corresponding barriers to sustainable land management and biodiversity conservation within dry forest and other Key Biodiversity Areas (KBAs) found in Tajikistan&#x2019;s Khatlon province. The project will deliver Global Env</narrative>
  </description>
